# MS5611 Driver

## Purpose

Driver for TE Connectivity MS5611 pressure sensor.

## Responsibilities

- Static pressure acquisition
- Temperature acquisition
- Redundant pressure source

## Outputs

- Static Pressure (Pa)
- Temperature (°C)
- Sensor Status

## Planned APIs

```c
void MS5611_Init(void);

float MS5611_ReadPressure(void);

float MS5611_ReadTemperature(void);

uint8_t MS5611_GetStatus(void);
